      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the study including 46 patients we found reduced regulatory and adaptive status defined by the parameters of cardiorespiratory synchronism, in patients experiencing pain caused by acute pulpitis. Significant inverse correlation was detected between the intensity of pain and the index of regulatory and adaptive status which was restored to normal after effective elimination of the pain."},
